OL,3,GNEWSAThe Prodigy to headline
OL,4,ACreamfields 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prodigy have been confirmed as the
OL,7,Ffirst headline act for the 30th
OL,8,FCreamfields Festival.
OL,10,FIt has been 14 years since the band
OL,11,Flast played at the dance music event,
OL,12,Fwhich is taking place from Thursday 26
OL,13,FAugust to Sunday 29 August 2027, at
OL,14,FDaresbury, near Runcorn.
OL,16,FBest known for their tracks Firestarter
OL,17,Fand Breathe, The Prodigy will take to
OL,18,Fthe stage on the Saturday night and are
OL,19,Fexpected to play songs from their
OL,20,Fcatalogue spanning 35 years.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
